{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":false,"promptId":"af5ea1f0-19a1-4fe1-83fe-fdc8506fd4b8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"You are judging candidate connections in a personal knowledge base.\n\nEach candidate below is a pair of articles that are NOT currently linked but\nshare neighbours in the wikilink graph. Structural proximity is only a hint -\nyour job is to decide whether a real, non-obvious relationship exists.\n\nREJECT when:\n- the two articles are merely about the same topic or domain\n- the relationship is obvious from the titles alone\n- a connection article would only restate what either article already says\n- the shared neighbours are generic infrastructure both happen to touch\n\nACCEPT only when a reader who already knew BOTH articles would still learn\nsomething from the relationship being made explicit - a shared root cause, a\ntransferable technique, a tension between two approaches, a pattern that\nrecurs across different domains.\n\nBe strict. Rejecting most candidates is the expected and correct outcome.\n\n## Articles you may [[wikilink]]\n\n- concepts/accidental-git-init-home-directory\n- concepts/advisor-invocation-failure-modes\n- concepts/applied-performance-biweekly-status-report\n- concepts/applied-performance-okr-system\n- concepts/arguable-threshold-design\n- concepts/at-utilization-benchmarks-project\n- concepts/ath-medicine-project\n- concepts/athlete-monitoring-rtp-presentation\n- concepts/athletics-performance-landing-page-spec\n- concepts/automated-layout-qa-gate\n- concepts/automation-stack-doctor\n- concepts/background-monitor-signal-reliability\n- concepts/backup-error-log-recurring-failures-2026-08-16\n- concepts/backup-manifest-coverage-gap-2026-09-09\n- concepts/backup-manifest-drift-and-launchd-status-lag\n- concepts/backup-manifest-symlink-false-alarm\n- concepts/backup-oom-kill-during-first-time-index\n- concepts/backup-status-ok-versus-job-count\n- concepts/backup-verification-by-restore\n- concepts/bayl